  "confidence": "low",
  "decision_summary": "Predicted pass: multiple structurally similar molecules show direct brain exposure after systemic administration (oral/IV, brain/plasma PK), while negative evidence is limited to a few chemotypes with similar or lower similarity. Low Morgan similarities and absence of cerebral-ischemia-condition data reduce confidence.",
